+# Revision — run 01M0QJ5FNE9XZJ72YN31K3X451
+
+- status reviewed: failed
+- review: .fabro/reviews/develop/01M0QJ5FNE9XZJ72YN31K3X451.md
+- seeds filed: fabro-83f9 Raise reviewer preamble budget from 12KB to 20-24KB; fabro-53d3 Add planner->refiner Blocked edge and output variant; fabro-a285 Mark seed fabro-d810 blocked-external with infeasibility facts; fabro-886e Add Evidence retry verdict to reviewer; fabro-a67c Remove tool-less contradiction from reviewer prompt; fabro-578a Restrict verification-only briefs to smoke-level commands; fabro-eaa0 Require English responses in implementer prompt; fabro-46a4 Stop restating the full painpoint list in every prompt
+
+## Findings
+
+### Raise reviewer preamble budget from 12KB to 20-24KB (filed: fabro-83f9)
+Raise `preamble_budget_kb` from 12 to 20-24 in `.fabro/workflows/develop/workflow.fabro` and correct the now-false "carries the evidence capture in full" claims. Expected effect: reviewer sees the full diff instead of ~400-char previews; avoids no-op rework cycles ($0.209, ~5 min, 32% of the run in this case).
+
+### Add planner->refiner Blocked edge and output variant (filed: fabro-53d3)
+Add a `planner -> refiner [label="Blocked"]` edge and a Blocked output variant to the planner outcome contract. Expected effect: planner Blocked routing no longer trips the goal gate and ends the run as `workflow_error` after successful implementation.
+
+### Mark seed fabro-d810 blocked-external with infeasibility facts (filed: fabro-a285)
+Fix seed `fabro-d810` via `sd`: add dependency on the denkhaus fabro-29f7 rebuild or deprioritize/label `blocked-external`, with infeasibility facts in the description. Expected effect: planners stop re-deriving known-dead state (~$0.26, ~7 min, 35% of the run per pass).
+
+### Add Evidence retry verdict to reviewer (filed: fabro-886e)
+Add a third "Evidence retry" route to `prompts/reviewer.md` plus a `reviewer -> evidence` edge. Expected effect: evidence-only re-runs no longer force a full no-op pipeline cycle ($0.21, ~5 min).
+
+### Remove tool-less contradiction from reviewer prompt (filed: fabro-a67c)
+Delete the "re-run `just qualitygate` yourself — you have tools" clause from `prompts/reviewer.md` line 13. Expected effect: reviewer prompt matches the tool-less `shape=tab` node.
+
+### Restrict verification-only briefs to smoke-level commands (filed: fabro-578a)
+Add smoke-level-only guidance to `prompts/planner.md` verification-only briefs. Expected effect: planner briefs no longer mandate `just qualitygate` that implementer rules forbid.
+
+### Require English responses in implementer prompt (filed: fabro-eaa0)
+Add "Always respond in English" to `prompts/implementer.md`. Expected effect: non-English replies stop leaking into downstream stage context.
+
+### Stop restating the full painpoint list in every prompt (filed: fabro-46a4)
+Emit only NEW painpoint entries to the append-only `.fabro/run-painpoints.jsonl` instead of restating the accumulated list in prompts. Expected effect: ~2.8KB/prompt saved, no truncated lossy accumulation at the reviewer node; compounds with the preamble budget raise.
